 "synopsis": "KP Group is planning an initial public offering of ₹4,000 crore for its subsidiary, Sun Drops Energia, expected within the next 10 to 12 months. The proposed listing will serve as the group's fourth public-market platform and provide promoter liquidity while financing capital-intensive expansion into battery energy storage systems, battery manufacturing, and group-captive renewable projects. Sun Drops is a subsidiary of KPI Green Energy and will house storage and smaller renewable projects under the group's FY32 roadmap.",
